    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Narration then names that public Gu refinement business Fang Yuan’s Great Love Gu refinement plan. Fang Yuan judges that if Giant Sun Immortal Venerable and Star Constellation Immortal Venerable target treasure yellow heaven instead of him, that would cripple the foundation of the plan, though he rates that possibility as slim. He also expects the two venerables are most likely to ignore the Gu refinement business they cannot stop and seek other advantages against the same Great Love Gu refinement plan.",
        "chapters": [
          2224
        ],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
